            "review_title": "Review at King Poutine",
            "review_text": "Mary e\n2 contributions\n0\nSuch a nice fine in HCM\nAug 2026 • Friends\nA wonderful concept to bring Poutine by a renowned chef to HCM. Great food and the owner is incredibly nice. She came to our table to tell us the history of the restaurant and all about their future plans for expansion in Da Nang. No doubt their enthusiasm, passion and overall joy will bring them much success.Great\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 28, 2026",
