            "review_title": "Review at King Poutine",
            "review_text": "Tom C\nWinchester, Tennessee3 contributions\n0\nMantoba Moose Fan\nJun 2026 • Solo\nI lived in Winnipeg, MB for 15 years, where poutine is an art form. I have been coast to coast to coast in Canada and never thought I'd find another poutine spot to rival Leopold's or Rae's, or Smoke's Poutinerie. But I found one - 12,000 kms from Portage and Main, right here in Ho Chi Minh City.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 8, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
